
<div id="urduTextPath">امام حسین (ع)/جب پریشاں ہوئی مولا کی جماعت رن میں</div>
<p>jab parishaan huwi moula ki jamaa'at ran me<br />
har namaazi ko pasand aayi iqaamat ran me<br />
qibla-e dee'n ne kiya qasde ibaadat ran me<br />
shakl-e mehraab bani tegh-e shahadat ran me</p>

<p>ghul huwa isko imaam-e dojahaa'n kehte hain<br />
teghou'n ke saaye me shabbir azaa'n kehte hain<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qudrat-e haq se dareeche huwe firdous ke waa<br />
daf'atan khul gaye dar haaye falak sartaapaa<br />
ek ba ek uth gaye sab parda-e arsh-e aala<br />
ambiyaa-o malak-o hoor ko pahonchi ye nidaa</p>

<p>qadardaa'n iska mai hoo'n mera shanasa hai ye<br />
kyu na ho mere mohammed ka nawaasa hai ye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye wo taa-at hai ke tanha hi adaa karte hai<br />
mere aashiq tah-e shamshir raha karte hai<br />
sar qalam hota hai wo shukr-e quda karte hai<br />
saadeq- ul waada yu'hi waada wafa karte hai</p>

<p>ham namaaz iske janaaze ki jo padhwaayenge<br />
tum bhi jana ke rasoolaan-e salaf jaayenge<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>saakin-e arsh-e bari'n karne lage naala-o aah<br />
shaah takbeer yahaan keh chuke allah allah<br />
aur iqaamat me huwe sarf shah-e aali jaah<br />
jaane waahid pa gire aan ke laakho bad qaah</p>

<p>soora e hamd nabi zaada padha chaahta tha<br />
shimr qanjar liye seene pa chadha jata tha<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>neem bismil ne zabaa'n se jo kaha bismillah<br />
naizaa maara abu ayyub ne lab par naagaah<br />
dar se saidaaniyaa'n chillayi ke innalillah<br />
haaye ye zulm namaazi pa ayaazan billah</p>

<p>waajibul qatl ko hai aab-o- ghiza ki mohlat<br />
jaan-e zehra ko na di farz-e quda ki mohlat<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zeenat-e- arsh-e baree'n qaak pa uftaadah hai<br />
na bichona hai na masnad hai na sajjaadah hai<br />
shimr qanjar liye baalee'n pa istaadah hai<br />
koi itna nahi kehta ke nabi zaada hai</p>

<p>qasd sajde ka idhar qibla-e dee'n karta hai<br />
niyyat-e zibha udhar shimr-e laee'n karta hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qanjar-e zulm ko chamka ke pukaara dushman<br />
bosagaah-e nabawi kaatu'n mai ab ya gardan<br />
bole sheh jis me tu raazi ho nahi jaaye suqan<br />
halq ye halq-e nabi hai ye badan unka badan</p>

<p>dekh sar nange har ek hoor-e jinaa'n aati hai<br />
abhi tu zibha na karna meri maa aati hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>naa-gahaa'n aayi ye awaaz ke amma sadqe<br />
mere maa baap fida mai tere qurbaa'n sadqe<br />
koun koun aaj huwa tujh pa meri jaa'n sadqe<br />
sher kitne huwe kitne huwe naada'n sadqe</p>

<p>qatl gaah ko abhi jannat se jo mai aati thi<br />
hoor ek nanhe se laashe ko liye jaati thi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qafela lutgaya amma mera lashkar na rahaa<br />
jadde amjad ki nashaani ali akbar na raha<br />
rehgaya dard-e- kamar haaye baradar na raha<br />
ab qabar aapne li aan ke jab ghar na rahaa</p>

<p>ek main hu so mujhe qatl ki mushtaaqi hai<br />
bosagaah-e nabawi katne ko ab baaqi hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>guftagu maadar-o farzand me hoti thi ye aah<br />
roti thi fatema mushtaaq-e shahadat the shaah<br />
aastee'n ghusse se qaatil ne chadhaayi naagaah<br />
qahar-e jallad pa ki shaah ne hasrat se nigaah</p>

<p>shimr ne poocha tumhe uzr koi ab to nahi<br />
bole shah dekhle darwaaze pa zainab to nahi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>wo pukaara nazar aati nahi dar par zainab<br />
peet'ti phirti hai qaime me khule sar zainab<br />
gar saraacho'n se chali aayegi baahar zainab<br />
rok sakne ki nahi par mera qanjar zainab</p>

<p>halq ko aapke be qouf-o qatar kaatoonga<br />
ek qanjar se bahan bhaai ka sar kaatoonga<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aayi zehra ki sadaa shimr tu naabeena hai<br />
dar pa zainab nahi baali'n pa magar zehra hai<br />
are be raham qataa mere pisar ki kya hai<br />
aastee'n ulti hai kyu tegh ko kyu khaincha hai</p>

<p>kya ise paala tha mai ne tere qanjar ke liye<br />
mere bachhe ko na kar zibha payambar ke liye<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>